# IntelliStream

Distributed AI Event Processing Platform for Real-Time Animal Health Monitoring

## Live Demo

Dashboard:
https://intellistream-2.onrender.com

API:
https://intellistream-1.onrender.com

## Tech Stack

- Python
- FastAPI
- Streamlit
- Kafka
- PostgreSQL
- Redis
- Docker
- Render
- Machine Learning

## Features

- Real-time event streaming
- Kafka-based producer-consumer architecture
- AI risk prediction
- PostgreSQL persistence
- Analytics dashboard
- Cloud deployment
